    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to watch them. my husband works extra shifts just to pay for the stuff i need, and my daughter barely gets to see her friends because she's always helping me with whatever. i feel like a thief, like i'm just stealing their lives away to keep myself going. i just want them to be able to have their own lives back.",
